# Haruka Scene v5
# Particle and decal probe (2026-11-20, Docs/Particles_And_Decals.md). Fixed seeds: the same --fixed-dt run gives the same PNG.
# Left: additive fountain (cone, gravity). Middle: alpha smoke (size and color curves, spin). Right: looping star burst (sphere, local space).
# Floor: red circle decal (replace), dark ring decal (multiply, glossy). Sphere: square decal from above (angle fade on the sides).
ACTOR:Sun
POS:0 0 0
ROT:-50 0 0
QUAT:-0.42261826 0 0 0.90630779
SCALE:1 1 1
ACTIVE:1
COMPONENT:LightComponent
enabled=1
type=directional
color=1 1 1
intensity=3
attenuationRadius=10
innerConeAngle=15
outerConeAngle=30
useTemperature=0
temperatureK=6500
castShadows=1
END_COMPONENT
END_ACTOR
